mand_test)\nResult                  : true\nTest Title              : Program Files directory permissions must conform to minimum requirements.\nCheck Existence         : One or more collected items must exist.\nCheck                   : All collected items must match the given state(s).\n\nObject ID               : oval:navy.navwar.niwcatlantic.scc.windows:obj:25327404 (shellcommand_object)\nObject Comment          : Run Icacls command against Program Files directory\nObject Requirement      :  check =  'shell' must be equal to 'powershell'\nObject Requirement      :  check =  'command' must be equal to 'icacls (Get-ItemProperty -Path \"HKLM:\\SOFTWARE\\Microsoft\\Windows\\CurrentVersion\" -Name ProgramFilesDir).ProgramFilesDir'\nObject Requirement      :  check =  'pattern' must be equal to ':'\n\nState ID                : oval:navy.navwar.niwcatlantic.scc.windows:ste:25327403 (shellcommand_state)\nState Comment           : Permissions must equal expected output\nState Requirement       : check_existence = 'at_least_one_exists',  check = all 'exit_status' must be equal to '0'\nState Requirement       : for allstdout_line, at least one of the following must be true:\nState Requirement       :     stdout_line must match the pattern '(?i)NT SERVICE\\\\TrustedInstaller:\\(F\\)'\nState Requirement       :     stdout_line must match the pattern '(?i)NT SERVICE\\\\TrustedInstaller:\\(CI\\)\\(IO\\)\\(F\\)'\nState Requirement       :     stdout_line must match the pattern '(?i)NT AUTHORITY\\\\SYSTEM:\\(M\\)'\nState Requirement       :     stdout_line must match the pattern '(?i)NT AUTHORITY\\\\SYSTEM:\\(OI\\)\\(CI\\)\\(IO\\)\\(F\\)'\nState Requirement       :     stdout_line must match the pattern '(?i)BUILTIN\\\\Administrators:\\(M\\)'\nState Requirement       :     stdout_line must match the pattern '(?i)BUILTIN\\\\Administrators:\\(OI\\)\\(CI\\)\\(IO\\)\\(F\\)'\nState Requirement       :     stdout_line must match the pattern '(?i)BUILTIN\\\\Users:\\(RX\\)'\nState Requi