ssets and detecting signs of suspicious and unexpected behavior.\n\nAuditing file shares records events related to connection to shares on a system including system shares such as C$.","mitigations":"","finding_details":"Tool: cpe:/a:niwc:scc:5.14.1\nTime         : 2026-09-05T13:03:20\nResult: passRule Result             : Pass\nCriteria                : true (All child tests must be true. (AND))\nCriteria                :   true (One or more child tests must be true. (OR))\nTest                    :     false ('Audit File Share' is set to 'Failure')\nTest                    :     true ('Audit File Share' is set to 'Success' and 'Failure')\n\n---\n\nTest ID                 : oval:mil.disa.stig.win:tst:25331900 (auditeventpolicysubcategories_test)\nResult                  : false\nTest Title              : 'Audit File Share' is set to 'Failure'\nCheck Existence         : One or more collected items must exist.\nCheck                   : All collected items must match the given state(s).\n\nObject ID               : oval:mil.disa.stig.win:obj:20000000 (auditeventpolicysubcategories_object)\nObject Comment          : \nObject Requirement      : Collect any available items.\n\nState ID                : oval:mil.disa.stig.win:ste:25331900 (auditeventpolicysubcategories_state)\nState Comment           : 'File Share' is set to 'Failure'\nState Requirement       : check_existence = 'at_least_one_exists',  check = all 'file_share' must be equal to 'AUDIT_FAILURE'\n\nCollected Item/State Result : false\n                        : credential_validation equals 'AUDIT_SUCCESS_FAILURE'\n                        : kerberos_authentication_service equals 'AUDIT_NONE'\n                        : kerberos_service_ticket_operations equals 'AUDIT_NONE'\n                        : kerberos_ticket_events equals 'AUDIT_NONE'\n                        : other_account_logon_events equals 'AUDIT_NONE'\n                        : application_group_management equals 'AUDIT_NONE'\n                    