'6'\n                        : windows_view equals '64_bit'\n","security_override_guidance":"","rule_title":"Windows 11 must be configured to require a minimum pin length of six characters or greater.","discussion":"Windows allows the use of PINs as well as biometrics for authentication without sending a password to a network or website where it could be compromised. Longer minimum PIN lengths increase the available combinations an attacker would have to attempt. Shorter minimum length significantly reduces the strength.","mitigations":"","stig_uuid":"3637ABFC-6BF8-1014-A5BB-C980152CC4B4","rule_version":"WN11-CC-000260","group_title":"SRG-OS-000480-GPOS-00227","severity":"medium","ccis":["CCI-000366"],"ia_controls":"","check_content":"If the following registry value does not exist or is not configured as specified, this is a finding:\n\nRegistry Hive: HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\nRegistry Path: \\SOFTWARE\\Policies\\Microsoft\\PassportForWork\\PINComplexity\\\n\nValue Name: MinimumPINLength\n\nType: REG_DWORD\nValue: 6 (or greater)","rule_id_src":"SV-253401r991589_rule","mitigation_control":"","rule_id":"SV-253401r991589","comments":null,"classification":"Unclassified","weight":"10.0","documentable":"false","reference_identifier":"5471","responsibility":"","third_party_tools":"","group_tree":{"title":"SRG-OS-000480-GPOS-00227","id":"V-253401"}},{"finding_details":"Tool: cpe:/a:niwc:scc:5.14.1\nTime         : 2026-09-05T13:03:20\nResult: passRule Result             : Pass\nCriteria                : true (All child tests must be true. (AND))\nCriteria                :   true (All child tests must be true. (AND))\nTest                    :     true ('Do not allow passwords to be saved' is set to 'Enabled')\n\n---\n\nTest ID                 : oval:mil.disa.stig.win:tst:25340200 (registry_test)\nResult                  : true\nTest Title              : 'Do not allow passwords to be saved' is set to 'Enabled'\nCheck Existence         : One or more collected items must exist.\nChec