253408","potential_impacts":"","false_positives":"","legacy_ids":[],"group_id_src":"V-253408","fix_text":"The default behavior is for the Windows RSS platform to not use Basic authentication over HTTP connections.\n\nTo correct this, configure the policy value for Computer Configuration &gt;&gt; Administrative Templates &gt;&gt; Windows Components &gt;&gt; RSS Feeds &gt;&gt; \"Turn on Basic feed authentication over HTTP\" to \"Not Configured\" or \"Disabled\".","rule_title":"Basic authentication for RSS feeds over HTTP must not be used.","security_override_guidance":"","mitigations":"","discussion":"Basic authentication uses plain text passwords that could be used to compromise a system.","stig_uuid":"3637ABFC-6BF8-1014-A5BB-C980152CC4B4","finding_details":"Tool: cpe:/a:niwc:scc:5.14.1\nTime         : 2026-09-05T13:03:20\nResult: passRule Result             : Pass\nCriteria                : true (All child tests must be true. (AND))\nCriteria                :   true (All child tests must be true. (AND))\nTest                    :     true ('Turn on Basic feed authentication over HTTP' is set to 'Not Configured' or 'Disabled')\n\n---\n\nTest ID                 : oval:mil.disa.stig.win:tst:25340800 (registry_test)\nResult                  : true\nTest Title              : 'Turn on Basic feed authentication over HTTP' is set to 'Not Configured' or 'Disabled'\nCheck Existence         : Zero or more collected items may exist.\nCheck                   : All collected items must match the given state(s).\n\nObject ID               : oval:mil.disa.stig.win:obj:25340800 (registry_object)\nObject Comment          : \nObject Requirement      :  check =  'hive' must be equal to 'HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE'\nObject Requirement      :  check =  'key' must be equal to 'Software\\Policies\\Microsoft\\Internet Explorer\\Feeds'\nObject Requirement      :  check =  'name' must be equal to 'AllowBasicAuthInClear'\n\nState ID                : oval:mil.disa.stig.win:ste:20000000 (registry_state)